"answer": "Project Zenith is a Q3 2023 initiative led by Marcus Cole aimed at optimizing cloud storage solutions for enhanced security and accessibility, with a specific focus on leveraging AI for data visualization and efficiency. The project timeline includes a kickoff on July 15th, a call for R&D proposals by July 20th, and initial findings reported on August 5th suggesting a 20% efficiency increase. The team has expanded with new members Mike Chen and Lisa Ray. Key developments include a partnership exploration with TechInnovate, a budget increase for compliance to $55,000, and an approved $15,000 training budget. Security protocols were updated for the following January, and feedback on the prototype was requested by November. Additionally, a request was made for stakeholders to send a confirmation email to contact@contact.com."
